	(text "LED SUPPLY SWITCH\n132 LEDs draw ~100 mA even when dark: the ESP32-C6 cuts their\nsupply for standby. LED_PWR_EN high = on; low or floating (boot) = off.\nR605/C605 slow the turn-on (inrush into the LEDs' 15 uF)."
